{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "label": "Tracing-Panel", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Flame-Graph und Waterfall ueber aufgezeichnete Message-Spans, live im Browser \u2014 ohne Collector und ohne Jaeger, aus den Spans, die das Framework ohnehin erzeugt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_trace_list", "label": "Die Trace-Liste", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Zeile pro Trace mit Route (Sender -> Actor -> Actor, aufeinanderfolgende Wiederholungen zusammengefasst), Message, Payload und Duration. Der Name einer Nachricht ist ihr kind, weil constructor.name bei jedem Objekt-Literal \"Object\" antwortet und damit nichts sagt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_flame_graph_vs_waterfall", "label": "Flame-Graph vs. Waterfall", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Flame-Graph legt Geschwister auf eine Zeile (wo ist die Zeit geblieben), der Waterfall gibt jedem eine eigene (was ist wann passiert); bei einer geraden Kette fallen beide zusammen. Zeiten kommen von einer monotonen Uhr in Mikrosekunden, weil Wall-Clock-Zeitstempel jeden Balken mit Breite null zeichnen wuerden."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_trace_requires_existing_context", "label": "Ein Actor traced nur, was schon zu einem Trace gehoert", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eine Cell oeffnet einen actor.receive-Span, wenn die Nachricht einen Trace-Context traegt oder bereits ein Span aktiv ist \u2014 und den ersten startet nichts im Framework. Ein schlichtes ref.tell zeichnet also nichts auf, und ein sichtbar beschaeftigtes System kann das Panel leer lassen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_span_buffer", "label": "Span-Puffer und Batching", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Spans gehen gebuendelt (Default alle 250 ms) statt einzeln, weil eine Nachricht mehrere Spans erzeugen kann und ein ausgelastetes System sonst eine Sturzflut ergaebe. Laeuft der Puffer ueber, fallen die aeltesten Spans und das Panel sagt wie viele \u2014 ein Flame-Graph handelt von der juengsten Vergangenheit."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_teetracer_coexistence", "label": "TeeTracer neben einem vorhandenen Tracer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ist schon ein Tracer installiert \u2014 etwa ein OTel-Adapter, der exportiert \u2014, wird er in einen TeeTracer gewickelt, sodass beide Konsumenten jeden Span sehen; beim Detachen steht der urspruengliche exakt wie vorher wieder da."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracerof_after_attach", "label": "tracerOf nach dem Attach holen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tracerOf(system) liefert den gerade installierten Tracer. In einer Variablen von vor DevTools.attach gehalten, bleibt es der Noop-Tracer, dessen withActiveSpan den Callback ausfuehrt und stillschweigend nichts aufzeichnet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_framework_span_sites", "label": "Was heute getracet wird", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das Framework oeffnet Spans an zwei Stellen: actor.receive (pro Nachricht, mit actor.path und actor.message.type) und cluster.envelope.received. Alles Weitere kommt aus Spans, die eigener Code startet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_devtools_actors_excluded_from_traces", "label": "DevTools-eigene Actors sind ausgenommen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ihre Probes empfangen Event-Stream-Publishes waehrend einer Anwendungsnachricht und tauchten sonst mitten in deren Route auf; ohne die withInternal-Markierung wuerde der Hub, der die Spans publiziert, jeden Batch als Payload des naechsten zurueckspeisen."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_trace_list", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_flame_graph_vs_waterfall", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_framework_span_sites", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_trace_requires_existing_context", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_framework_span_sites", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_span_buffer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_teetracer_coexistence", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracerof_after_attach", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_devtools_actors_excluded_from_traces", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracing_panel", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_protocol_tap_streams", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_tracerof_after_attach", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_overview_devtools_attach", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_flame_graph_vs_waterfall", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_profiler_wallclock_mode", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_tracing_span_buffer", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_observability_devtools_actor_visualizer_busiest_mailboxes", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.65, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/observability/devtools/tracing.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}], "h